       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEST-POSTPROCESS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(9)V99.
       01 WS-STATUS PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCESS.
           MOVE 100 TO WS-AMOUNT.
           PERFORM CALC-INTEREST.
           STOP RUN.
       CALC-INTEREST.
           COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = WS-AMOUNT * 1.05.
           MOVE "DONE" TO WS-STATUS.
